        "id": 127949,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-17T23:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One of Deadline’s weaknesses compared to other villains is that because he nukes his catastrophes,  he’s less likely to blitz into a superior board state that the heroes are unable to deal with for the rest of the game.  So he’s less likely to get blow-out victories than some of the other villains. (I think.  I’ve only played him once)</p>",
