        "id": 127950,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-18T02:10:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t know, I’ve had turns where he starts out with 2 catastrophes, then busts out 5 more with an unnatural disaster, then wipes out half of the environment in one fell swoop, while dealing 7 irreducible fire damage to everybody.</p>\n<p>It’s true that he doesn’t set up ridiculous shutdown combos like Dawn, the Chairman, or La Capitan, but he doesn’t need to. He has brutal combo attacks that can devastate when they are least expected.</p>",
