        "username": "BenjaminTodd",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ecc23a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-19T22:21:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You do not discard the cards, you remove them from the game.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You physically have to destroy the cards.&nbsp; A pair of scissors or a lighter will do it.&nbsp; Makes Deadline seriously nasty to play.&nbsp; I've already lost half of  the Megalopolis  enviro deck. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Ben</p>",
