      {
        "id": 127954,
        "name": "Flintlock",
        "username": "Flintlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/flintlock/{size}/2183_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T15:09:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Even following the rules, he has yet to impress our group as far as challenges go.</p><p>Then again, the first time we fought him, I might have Mistbound him for five out of the six turns it took to K.O. him. Yeah...not allowed to do that again.</p><p>Second time was without shenanigans, but we had consistent ongoing removal on the table which, as mentioned, seriously hamstrings his game plan. He still came off as pretty easily handled.</p>",
