        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T15:32:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Deadline advanced for his front side is more balancing than straight harder.</p><p>Deadline will most likely be played Advanced front side, non-advanced back side as his standard form. &nbsp;We do the same for Ennead, because normal is mostly too easy, and advanced on the back is really hard. &nbsp;So for our \"we want a challenge but not a really tough challenge,\" games we do advanced front, normal back.</p>",
