      {
        "id": 127957,
        "name": "phelpsfunk",
        "username": "phelpsfunk",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/51bf81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-21T21:29:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Follow-up questions about Deadline's flipping:</p><p>So, 3 Catastrophes in play at end of turn. &nbsp;He Flips. &nbsp; Does his new \"end of turn\" event on the back side take effect right away, or at the end of his next turn? If it does take effect the same turn he flips, does it happen right away, or does it become the \"newest\" card in play and therefore the last card of \"end of turn\" to take effect?</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:02:39.200Z",
